{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_title", "source_sha256": "5dc8fb8c864dd2eabe9043adf437a5ff65e6d471bde2841a2456b5a264fecaeb", "ja": "『真美、不退転の決意！』の巻！", "zh": "“真美，坚如磐石的决心！”篇！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3f2db67f5ea949400df404c869fddf1efb2d99eb00262c5919f490b2f76d918e", "ja": "最近大人っぽくなったと評判の亜美に対抗\n意識を燃やし、セクシー特訓に励む真美。\n亜美とはずっと一緒だったから、変わるのも\n一緒だと思っていたと話す。気持ちを\n切り替えた真美には、成長が感じられた。", "zh": "面对最近被夸变成熟的亚美，真美燃起了\n竞争意识，努力进行性感特训。\n她说因为一直和亚美在一起，所以觉得\n改变也会是同步的。而在转换了心情的\n真美身上，切实让人感受到了她的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d78700e4d16dc55b858122b1fb86d12daaca8b63618a1b8e741232013f2ffd22", "ja": "（定期公演、真美の新曲ステージが終わった。\n客席に溢れかえる笑顔が、全ての答えだろう）", "zh": "（定期公演结束了，真美的新歌舞台也落下了帷幕。观众席上洋溢着的笑容，就是全部的答案吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "a23645604b7fd166ed9465e995a024d6da6f8fc5e81456b5a14fdc5ca11a1984", "ja": "ファンの兄ちゃん姉ちゃんたちーっ！\n真美の新曲、どうだった？　楽しかったー！？", "zh": "粉丝们的哥哥姐姐们——！\n真美的新歌怎么样？开心吗——？！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "a4847e932145010396f850c3b81ec675db9c95af5ce2692ee5368c184232e8d2", "ja": "ワアアァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "4b829c3dec78acec70b826e8c8407f2437f0242b332969d31a8538e80a61ae96", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとーっ！　今日は亜美がいないから、\n真美、いつもの倍は働いた気がするよ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢——！今天因为亚美不在，\n真美感觉自己干了平时两倍的活儿呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "bc57b3726ad46f37a6836eec697b7243b815d6b135e7bc2c5a82e9c2b4c23a27", "ja": "真美と亜美、ふたりのコトも多いけど……\nソロのアイドルとしても、イケてるっしょ？", "zh": "真美和亚美经常一起行动，不过……\n作为单独的偶像，也很厉害吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "c986ed2c922d7b6ae376102f278620b154d7398161e813ba68f97248f1ed207e", "ja": "双子は、一番身近なライバルだかんね！　真美は\nこれからもっと成長しちゃうから、応援よろよろ～！", "zh": "双胞胎可是最亲近的对手呢！真美接下来还会继续成长的，所以请多多支持啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "a4847e932145010396f850c3b81ec675db9c95af5ce2692ee5368c184232e8d2", "ja": "ワアアァァーッ！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "bf942e93e8d22de0a01626a875ca9aa57b3cc4be47abf95c868cbab60de219e5", "ja": "兄ちゃん、お疲れ♪\nどう？　メッチャいいステージだったっしょ？", "zh": "哥哥，辛苦啦♪\n怎么样？刚才的舞台超棒的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3c27f184927c753ed7acf948a2818e20194b5968bfb11876a2e53b9f273a43d9", "ja": "ああ、文句なしだ。\n本当によくやってくれたな。みんなも、お疲れさま。", "zh": "啊，无可挑剔。\n你们真的做得很好。大家也辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "5ec85e90ef98171101d4e4fa899f3acf082737df3424adecdd27c2f5896a7953", "ja": "お疲れさまで～す！\nあー、楽しかった♪　ね、エレナちゃん？", "zh": "辛苦啦～！\n啊——真开心♪对吧，艾蕾娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "ee413e23b8ca4d354f7e4818860e5589b8c5e801718f997a3ea9578b1e11e617", "ja": "うん！　すっごく楽しいライブだったヨ♪", "zh": "嗯！真是一场超级开心的演唱会呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "4e35b015f4760dc7447ec1a1d42b50d92ab13f2c3304557963ea9683ab38ace7", "ja": "オレも楽しかった～！　途中で\n方向転換したのに、よくここまでやれたよな～。", "zh": "我也玩得很开心～！明明中途改变了方向，居然也能做到这种程度，真厉害啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "39b91111d8701785938670c794c32e0a5d02db65677d5e57814e762ee80c5fca", "ja": "セクシーレッスンも楽しかったけど……\nやっぱりマミには、こっちが正解だったみたいだネ♪", "zh": "性感课程也很开心，不过……果然对真美来说，还是这个才是正确答案呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "57fea9439978ce8470fdb32018fedec95b9cc1bc79c3c0495a19784880bf695a", "ja": "真美としては、セクシーも大正解だと思うんだけど……\nせっかく、このみんに先生をお願いしたのにな～。", "zh": "在真美看来，性感路线也是完全正确的答案啦……  \n难得还请了小此美来当老师呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "4e91c5b07037c397114b7f9d24566a175626c87c3b2cedd9ba33310ad8b737ab", "ja": "ふふっ、気にしないで！\nそれに、個人的に思うところもあったのよね。", "zh": "呵呵，不用在意！\n而且，我个人也有些想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1da296d8b4144d58dcf8442e4e4e059fc44f2d0c1cd7d0d5c70174d93ac885d4", "ja": "個人的に、ですか？", "zh": "是个人方面的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "fdd1b143545a061da1b0fb7e7ff2945893bad15a804325e3c56a222f2b6497b2", "ja": "ええ。真美ちゃんは、お姉ちゃんでしょ？\n私も妹がいるから、わかる気がしたの。", "zh": "嗯。真美是姐姐对吧？\n因为我也有妹妹，所以感觉很能理解呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "7e217dbb65bdfa168efa273bb74ace8e58a73b811bda9d6e7da1505002a17cca", "ja": "妹には負けられない、って気持ち。\n他人事とは思えなくて、気合いが入っちゃったのよ。", "zh": "那种“不能输给妹妹”的心情。\n我没办法当成别人的事，所以就干劲十足了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "a4ba647de229611a0320895f6975f680939860f265c3cd12ec40d139d423f38e", "ja": "このみん……。", "zh": "好感动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1019_039kon", "source_sha256": "bdf0d7eb80b1701feb2035812edf548050708f7974201b78b37e35ef51869569", "ja": "ウフフ♪　お姉ちゃんって、大変よね！", "zh": "呵呵♪当姐姐也很辛苦呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "0f92578eb6c6baaaf65a1f21da51821f771c6e74d8ab0dcd4c0854845ac3fe46", "ja": "ね～っ！　……えへへ。", "zh": "就是说嘛～！……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "8836ac4410aff177bbe89eadabbbdcef78acc71c1a56a29cf590f8a7ddffbb07", "ja": "真美、このみ！\n続きは、着替えてからにしようぜ。", "zh": "真美、木实！\n接下来，换好衣服再继续吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "c75404b5c3e5a7ee5667b3ba8f82bdcabb4243b9eb763756442d0804b58cfc66", "ja": "汗かいちゃったもんね。\nみんな、行きましょー！", "zh": "都出汗了呢。\n大家，我们走吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "a707b879918f217ee5498f33718e9bfe8f31b2945ff8523322a1312a83f1e231", "ja": "……ねえねえ、兄ちゃん！\n今日の真美、すっごく大人っぽかったと思わない？", "zh": "……呐呐，哥！\n你觉不觉得，今天的真美超级有成熟大人的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1024_p", "source_sha256": "950ceb834ded88b2c16886cd61b5343484c80cce91fb07d20d943f1a7ecfd3d6", "ja": "そうだな。すっごく……かどうかはわからないけど、\n少なくとも、真美の成長を感じたよ。", "zh": "是啊。是不是特别成熟我倒说不好，不过至少，我确实感受到了真美的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "355cb6da9a4d70fb8f2f09dff2817971d98aa52b2e80227f7d0ce1338daf7a6e", "ja": "そっかー。兄ちゃんも、真美の\nナチュラルなオトナの魅力にやられたかー。", "zh": "这样啊——哥哥也被真美自然流露出的成熟魅力迷住了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "b449664da3a7349ab39676a42ec8dfded18c360839c05635c260273e914bc87b", "ja": "んじゃ、真美も着替えてくるね！　真美が\nカワイイからって、覗きに来たらダメだよ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "那我真美也去换衣服啦！就算真美\n很可爱，你也不能跑来偷看哦，哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1027_p", "source_sha256": "709864acf54378f1297f46650c812ecbd49bc529acc6c5d7f180b271198d63cd", "ja": "またそうやって、人聞きの悪いことを……\nこら、真美ー！", "zh": "你又这样，说些容易让人误会的话……\n喂，真美——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_108_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_108_1028_p", "source_sha256": "72b6bcc794e4f06d12682c7944b34e92a544959a367ba541484b847e7b6519eb", "ja": "（変わらないところもあるけど……お疲れさま、真美。\n本当に、いいステージを見せてもらったぞ！）", "zh": "（虽然还有些地方没有改变……辛苦了，真美。\n真的给我们带来了精彩的舞台！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
